exports[`frame at 80x24 fills the screen without overflow and shows all three panes and the legend 1`] = `
" keymap-helper  lua/mappings.template.json                    1 removed   saved 
 Categories       3  Uncategorized              1/43  Details                   
 ! Uncategorized 43   n     <leader>ff  find fi… rhs  <leader>ff                
 ■ Lsp            1   nv    <leader>fg  live gr… rhs  modes    n                
 ■ Keys           1   raw   local map = vim.key… raw  category Uncategorized    
                      n     <leader>z0  do <lea… rhs  desc     find files       
                      n     <leader>z1  do <lea… rhs  action   rhs :<leader>ff  
                      n     <leader>z2  do <lea… rhs  options  silent           
                      n     <leader>z3  do <lea… rhs  generated Lua             
                      n     <leader>z4  do <lea… rhs  map("n", "<leader>ff",    
                      n     <leader>z5  do <lea… rhs  ":<leader>ff")            
                      n     <leader>z6  do <lea… rhs                            
                      n     <leader>z7  do <lea… rhs                            
 entries are grouped by category on load; nothing is written until you save     
 j k   move              m     move to...        o     other entry              
 h l   pane              c     new category      x     delete shadowed          
 gg G  first, last       r     rename            P     swap winner              
 ^d ^u half page         d     delete category   D     removed defs             
 / n N search            J K   reorder entry     i     preview import           
 space mark, next        < >   reorder category  O     options                  
 v     mark              C     category color    w     save                     
 V     range             u ^r  undo, redo        q     quit                     
 A     mark all          !     conflicts only                                   
 esc   clear marks       ]c [c jump conflict                                    "
`;

